{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by <i>Space Invaders</i> and <i>Vampire Survivors</i>, <i>Interstellar Survivor</i> is a space shooter where you face an endless onslaught of asteroids!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Currently you can navigate left and right with your spaceship, which will fire automatically and can destroy incoming asteroids to increase your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your HP runs out, the game is over, and you will need to press &quot;Alt + F4&quot; to exit the game until a menu is implemented.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599840?t=1744590786","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599840?t=1744590786","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599840/3f27624030e19f8e2ac283cbccd3d60a8aa5ee71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744590786","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599840/3f27624030e19f8e2ac283cbccd3d60a8aa5ee71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744590786","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>News</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey, I'm a new game developer and this is my first game! ^^</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On my twitter page\u00a0<strong>&quot;FreljordGames&quot;\u00a0</strong>you can send me suggestions for adjustments and expansions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planned future features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Asteroids will collide with the screen edges and bounce off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Additional weapon types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Upgrades for weapon strength, health points, speed, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Improvements to UI &amp; graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have fun playing! ^^</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by <i>Space Invaders</i> and <i>Vampire Survivors</i>, <i>Interstellar Survivor</i> is a space shooter where you face an endless onslaught of asteroids!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Currently you can navigate left and right with your spaceship, which will fire automatically and can destroy incoming asteroids to increase your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your HP runs out, the game is over, and you will need to press &quot;Alt + F4&quot; to exit the game until a menu is implemented.</p>","developers":["FreljordGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599840/e47e7398682782741df3fbff39c76ef3a98beeb5/header.jpg?t=1744590786","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257115129,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115129/movie480.mp4?t=1744590784","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115129/movie_max.mp4?t=1744590784"},"name":"Interstellar Survivor Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257115129/b37f024aa91964626344712b51e7351a7c448cec/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744590784","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115129/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744590784","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115129/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744590784"}}],"name":"Interstellar Survivor","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<